  "releaseNotes": "Adds multiple selection to SheryComboBox: set SelectionMode=\"Multiple\" and bind SelectedItems to a mutable list such as an ObservableCollection. Choices show as removable chips that wrap inside the field, and the list stays open while the user toggles rows. Single selection is unchanged and remains the default. New string key SheryStringKeys.RemoveNamed, with English and Persian built in. Full notes in CHANGELOG.md.",
